732">汗在</span><span begin="42.732" end="43.106">流</span> <span begin="43.106" end="43.479">血在</span><span begin="43.479" end="43.852">淌</span> <span begin="43.852" end="44.225">兄弟</span><span begin="44.225" end="44.412">硬</span> <span begin="44.412" end="44.599">我们</span><span begin="44.599" end="44.972">产业</span><span begin="44.972" end="45.279">广</span></p><p begin="45.320" end="48.249" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.320" end="46.439">以前吃不起饭</span> <span begin="46.439" end="47.931">现在赚好多都没法</span><span begin="47.931" end="48.249">讲</span></p></div><div begin="48.297" end="1:00.118" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.297" end="51.222" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.297" end="48.674">我的</span><span begin="48.674" end="49.051">瞳</span><span begin="49.051" end="49.428">孔</span><span begin="49.428" end="49.838">已通</span><span begin="49.838" end="50.251">红</span> <span begin="50.251" end="51.064">热血又放</span><span begin="51.064" end="51.222">纵</span></p><p begin="51.232" end="54.177" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.232" end="51.633">要把</span><span begin="51.633" end="52.035">地</span><span begin="52.035" end="52.436">面给</span><span begin="52.436" end="52.588">撞</span><span begin="52.588" end="52.897">个</span><span begin="52.897" end="53.275">洞</span> <span begin="53.275" end="54.034">再飞过苍</span><span begin="54.034" end="54.177">穹</span></p><p begin="54.187" end="57.162" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.187" end="54.562">以前</span><span begin="54.562" end="54.936">口</span><span begin="54.936" end="55.311">袋</span><span begin="55.311" end="55.481">两</span><span begin="55.481" end="55.852">空</span><span begin="55.852" end="56.261">空</span> <span begin="56.261" end="56.985">在水库野</span><span begin="56.985" end="57.162">泳</span></p><p begin="57.172" end="1:00.118" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.172" end="58.656">曾经一起混的野种</span> <span begin="58.656" end="59.769">他们为我感到</span><span begin="59.769" end="1:00.118">光荣</span></p></div><div begin="1:00.128" end="1:11.810" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:00.128" end="1:03.088" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.128" end="1:00.503">一个</span> <span begin="1:00.503" end="1:00.877">两个</span> <span begin="1:00.877" end="1:01.252">三个</span> <span begin="1:01.252" end="1:01.627">四个</span> <span begin="1:01.627" end="1:02.751">想被点名 不够</span><span begin="1:02.751" end="1:03.088">格</span></p><p begin="1:03.124" end="1:06.053" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.124" end="1:04.779">五万人的场子带不动</span> <span begin="1:04.779" end="1:05.698">说场子不够</span><span begin="1:05.698" end="1:06.053">热</span></p><p begin="1:06.063" end="1:09.015" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.063" end="1:07.753">成年人把体面留给你</span> <span begin="1:07.753" end="1:08.692">还以为自己</span><span begin="1:08.692" end="1:09.015">能</span></p><p begin="1:09.025" end="1:11.810" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.025" end="1:10.144">我该自我检讨</span> <span begin="1:10.144" end="1:11.636">那些事我做得不够</span><span begin="1:11.636" end="1:11.810">绝</span></p></div><div begin="1:11.820" end="1:23.854" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:11.820" end="1:14.978" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.820" end="1:12.181">那</span><span begin="1:12.181" end="1:12.371">杂</span><span begin="1:12.371" end="1:12.715">别</span><span begin="1:12.715" end="1:13.475">还有改咋</span><span begin="1:13.475" end="1:13.855">别</span> <span begin="1:13.855" end="1:14.615">你是真的</span><span begin="1:14.615" end="1:14.978">缺</span></p><p begin="1:14.988" end="1:17.925" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.988" end="1:16.100">闭哒眼睛喊老</span><span begin="1:16.100" end="1:16.471">兄</span> <span begin="1:16.471" end="1:17.583">到底哪个跟你</span><span begin="1:17.583" end="1:17.925">铁</span></p><p begin="1:17.935" end="1:20.875" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.935" end="1:19.617">再哒我要呸你滴时候</span> <span begin="1:19.617" end="1:19.804">要</span><span begin="1:19.804" end="1:20.552">脑壳抬起</span><span begin="1:20.552" end="1:20.875">接</span></p><p begin="1:20.885" end="1:23.854" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.885" end="1:22.200">长沙不止三杂别</span> <span begin="1:22.200" end="1:23.514">老子也不止三滴</span><span begin="1:23.514" end="1:23.854">血</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.864" end="1:35.874" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:23.864" end="1:26.914" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.864" end="1:25.333">老子天天都在过节</span> <span begin="1:25.333" end="1:26.435">我的家人就是</span><span begin="1:26.435" end="1:26.914">礼物</span></p><p begin="1:26.991" end="1:29.910" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.991" end="1:28.132">超哥想证明自</span><span begin="1:28.132" end="1:28.450">己</span> <span begin="1:28.450" end="1:29.393">所以爱到处</span><span begin="1:29.393" end="1:29.614">bee</span><span begin="1:29.614" end="1:29.910">f</span></p><p begin="1:29.933" end="1:32.851" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.933" end="1:31.078">你眼睛都是虚</span><span begin="1:31.078" end="1:31.459">嘞</span> <span begin="1:31.459" end="1:32.570">我晓得你的秘</span><span begin="1:32.570" end="1:32.851">密</span></p><p begin="1:32.915" end="1:35.874" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.915" end="1:34.207">要沾点不讲道义</span> <span begin="1:34.207" end="1:35.500">弄你根本不费力</span><span begin="1:35.500" end="1:35.874">气</span></p></div><div begin="1:35.301" end="1:47.008" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:35.301" end="1:38.072" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.301" end="1:36.053">看到我们</span><span begin="1:36.053" end="1:36.429">成</span><span begin="1:36.429" end="1:37.557">功 你羡慕加嫉</span><span begin="1:37.557" end="1:38.072">妒</span></p><p begin="1:38.092" end="1:40.843" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.092" end="1:38.328">我</span><span begin="1:38.328" end="1:39.062">掐到你的</span><span begin="1:39.062" end="1:39.429">人</span><span begin="1:39.429" end="1:40.530">中 我问你服不</span><span begin="1:40.530" end="1:40.843">服</span></p><p begin="1:40.875" end="1:43.885" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.875" end="1:41.999">说不打你我没</span><span begin="1:41.999" end="1:42.373">忍</span><span begin="1:42.373" end="1:43.497">住 我喊你不要</span><span begin="1:43.497" end="1:43.885">哭</span></p><p begin="1:44.039" end="1:47.008" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.039" end="1:44.189">你</span><span begin="1:44.189" end="1:44.943">说你住在</span><span begin="1:44.943" end="1:45.320">成</span><span begin="1:45.320" end="1:46.450">都 我跟他们不</span><span begin="1:46.450" end="1:47.008">熟</span></p></div><div begin="1:47.548" end="1:59.417" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:47.548" end="1:50.501" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.548" end="1:47.915">我有</span><span begin="1:47.915" end="1:48.281">仁</span><span begin="1:48.281" end="1:48.648">义</span><span begin="1:48.648" end="1:49.014">礼智</span><span begin="1:49.014" end="1:49.381">信</span> <span begin="1:49.381" end="1:49.579">啥</span><span begin="1:49.579" end="1:49.777">子都</span><span begin="1:49.777" end="1:50.173">搞得</span><span begin="1:50.173" end="1:50.501">定</span></p><p begin="1:50.539" end="1:53.437" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.539" end="1:50.914">我的</span><span begin="1:50.914" end="1:51.289">歌</span><span begin="1:51.289" end="1:52.038">不在酒吧</span><span begin="1:52.038" end="1:52.413">放 我</span><span begin="1:52.413" end="1:53.163">送给老百</span><span begin="1:53.163" end="1:53.437">姓</span></p><p begin="1:53.479" end="1:56.438" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.479" end="1:53.854">我有</span><span begin="1:53.854" end="1:54.228">仁</span><span begin="1:54.228" end="1:54.603">义</span><span begin="1:54.603" end="1:54.978">礼智</span><span begin="1:54.978" end="1:55.353">信 我</span><span begin="1:55.353" end="1:56.102">说话你要</span><span begin="1:56.102" end="1:56.438">听</span></p><p begin="1:56.466" end="1:59.4